WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:09.360
SCP-682 Vs SCP-3207. No weapon the Foundation&nbsp;
has ever created has been able to kill SCP-682,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.840
so maybe a crazy anomalous energy cannon created&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.280
by Leonardo Davinci and Marco&nbsp;
Saul will get the job done.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.120
The tissue test went well, as the energy&nbsp;
cannon was able to completely vaporize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.000
the SCP-682 flesh with a single blast.
With this promising result, they went&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.600
on to the full test: 3207 appeared to completely&nbsp;
annihilate SCP-682 with a few well-aimed blasts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.120
leading to a great deal of relief among the&nbsp;
attending researchers… For a few hours, at least.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:42.320
Several nasty little creatures regenerated&nbsp;
from the scattered tissue of SCP-682. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:49.040
these creatures breached containment, they fused&nbsp;
back into SCP-682. Because of course they did.

